{"suttaId":"tha-ap139","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[6174,6198],"vripara":"47"},"segments":{"tha-ap139:0.3":"Atthasandassakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap139:1.1":"“Visālamāḷe āsīno, addasaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","tha-ap139:1.3":"Khīṇāsavaṃ balappattaṃ, bhikkhusaṅghapurakkhataṃ.","tha-ap139:2.1":"“Satasahassā tevijjā, chaḷabhiññā mahiddhikā;","tha-ap139:2.3":"Parivārenti sambuddhaṃ, ko disvā nappasīdati.","tha-ap139:3.1":"“Ñāṇe upanidhā yassa, na vijjati sadevake;","tha-ap139:3.3":"Anantañāṇaṃ sambuddhaṃ, ko disvā nappasīdati.","tha-ap139:4.1":"“Dhammakāyañca dīpentaṃ, kevalaṃ ratanākaraṃ;","tha-ap139:4.3":"Vikappetuṃ [vikopetuṃ (sī. syā.)] na sakkonti, ko disvā nappasīdati.","tha-ap139:5.1":"“Imāhi tīhi gāthāhi, nāradovhayavacchalo [saragacchiyo (sī.), puragacchiyo (syā.)];","tha-ap139:5.3":"Padumuttaraṃ thavitvāna, sambuddhaṃ aparājitaṃ.","tha-ap139:6.1":"“Tena cittappasādena, buddhasanthavanena ca;","tha-ap139:6.3":"Kappānaṃ satasahassaṃ, duggatiṃ, nupapajjahaṃ.","tha-ap139:7.1":"“Ito tiṃsakappasate, sumitto nāma khattiyo;","tha-ap139:7.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap139:8.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap139:9.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā atthasandassako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap139:10.1":"Atthasandassakattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2966,"to":2966,"paras":[{"para":2966,"vripara":"47","refs":["tha-ap139:1"],"words":["visālamāḷe āsīno","visālamāḷe","āsīno"],"lines":["So attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>visālamāḷe āsīno</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha <b>visālamāḷe</b>ti visālaṃ patthaṭaṃ vitthiṇṇaṃ mahantaṃ māḷaṃ visālamāḷaṃ, tasmiṃ visālamāḷe <b>āsīno</b> nisinno ahaṃ lokanāyakaṃ addasanti sambandho.","Tesaṃ suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap139:1"],["tha-ap139:1"],["tha-ap139:1"]]}]},"tika":null}
